title: config-service replica stop, no outage
description: Disaster recovery test of the config store of the docs pictures whose fault has no visible effect. One replica of three stops and the store keeps answering, so the probes see no outage and the RTO is inconclusive. The run is no evidence of recovery. The lab is a folder of files that data.py makes.

tags[2]: dr, replica
kind: dr
target:
  system: config-service
  technology: configuration
  environment: demo
rto_target_s: 30

steady_state_hypothesis:
  title: The config store answers
  probes[1]:
    - name: store-answers
      activity_type: probe
      provider:
        type: process
        path: sh
        arguments[3]: "${lab}/lab.sh", "${lab}", up
        timeout_s: 5.0
      tolerance:
        type: regex
        pattern: "^up$"

method[1]:
  - name: stop-one-replica
    activity_type: action
    provider:
      type: process
      path: sh
      arguments[3]: "${lab}/lab.sh", "${lab}", replica
      timeout_s: 5.0

rollbacks[0]:
